<dataset xmlns:json="http://www.json.org" id="1.2.40.0.34.777.1.1.1" effectiveDate="2017-06-21T00:00:00" statusCode="draft" versionLabel="v2" prefix="elgabbr-" shortName="elga_basisdataset" iddisplay="elgabbr-dataset(v2)-" url="http://art-decor.org/decor/services/" ident="elgabbr-"><!--
 This is a view of the dataset "ELGA Basis-Dataset" containing DECOR specifications for a transaction or dataset in a single, hierarchical view. 
